]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1K">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "11">
<configtype typenbr = "4">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENKSB0A1B46004" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Exhaust Pipe and Muffler Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
For replacement of exhaust pipe and muffler, refer to 
<intxref refid = "AENKSB0A1B46001">Exhaust System Components:K14C</intxref>
 and the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Before removal of exhaust pipe, remove engine undercover.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Before removal of exhaust center pipe (1), remove floor tunnel brace (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A1B4010.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "52.905mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "133"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Use new gasket and seal rings.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tightening new muffler tail pipe bolts (1) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1K424">
<t-part>
Muffler tail pipe bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
11
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
1.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
8.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A1B4011.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "50.365mm" ver = "01" gw = "228" gh = "126"/>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Install mounting No.2 (1) positioning its cavity (2) longitudinally.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A1B4012.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "52.905mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "133"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[f]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Forward
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Tighten bolts and nuts to specified torque when reassembling. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENKSB0A1B46001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Run engine and check for exhaust gas leakage.
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
